message: "If you use this brief, its taxonomy or the explorer, please cite it as below."
title: "The Value of Open Research Information: Nine Transformative Benefits (Barcelona Declaration WG7-TF2)"
abstract: >-
  What research systems gain when information about research is open, as a brief
  and an interactive explorer: nine benefit dimensions in three axes (Quality &
  Trust, Collaboration & Innovation, Impact & Relevance) flowing into trustworthy
  research, sustainable innovation and societal impact. Contribution to Task Force
  2 of Working Group 7 of the Barcelona Declaration on Open Research Information.
  This is version 0.2 of a working document. The ninth benefit (B9 Strategic
  Steering & Institutional Autonomy) and the narrowing of B2 are proposals put to
  WG7-TF2 at its meeting of 1 September 2026, not decisions the task force has
  taken. The explorer runs entirely in the browser and is available in English,
  German and Spanish.
